   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Aşağıda dört farklı araştırmada toplanan veriler ve bu verilerin gösterilebileceği grafik türleri verilmiştir.</p><p><b>I.</b> Bir şehirde bir yıl boyunca her ay ölçülen yağış miktarının aylara göre nasıl değiştiği<br><b>II.</b> Bir ailenin aylık gelirinin kira, mutfak, ulaşım ve birikim kalemlerine nasıl paylaştırıldığı<br><b>III.</b> Beş ilin 2025 yılındaki çay üretim miktarlarının birbiriyle karşılaştırılması<br><b>IV.</b> Bir öğrencinin girdiği 6 deneme sınavındaki netleri ile sınıfın net ortalamasının denemelere göre değişiminin karşılaştırılması</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 156\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Dört gösterim: K sütun grafiği, L çizgi grafiği, M daire grafiği, N iki veri gruplu çizgi grafiği.\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"10.0\" width=\"128.0\" height=\"84.0\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"6\"/><line x1=\"33.0\" y1=\"82.0\" x2=\"33.0\" y2=\"20.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"33.0\" y1=\"82.0\" x2=\"131.0\" y2=\"82.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"43.0\" y=\"42.0\" width=\"14.0\" height=\"40.0\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"66.0\" y=\"56.0\" width=\"14.0\" height=\"26.0\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"89.0\" y=\"30.0\" width=\"14.0\" height=\"52.0\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"112.0\" y=\"64.0\" width=\"14.0\" height=\"18.0\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"79.0\" y=\"114.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">K</text><text x=\"79.0\" y=\"132.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Sütun grafiği</text><rect x=\"163.0\" y=\"10.0\" width=\"128.0\" height=\"84.0\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"6\"/><line x1=\"181.0\" y1=\"82.0\" x2=\"181.0\" y2=\"20.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"181.0\" y1=\"82.0\" x2=\"279.0\" y2=\"82.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><polyline points=\"191,68 213,48 235,56 257,32 275,38\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"191\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7c3aed\"/><circle cx=\"213\" cy=\"48\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7c3aed\"/><circle cx=\"235\" cy=\"56\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7c3aed\"/><circle cx=\"257\" cy=\"32\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7c3aed\"/><circle cx=\"275\" cy=\"38\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7c3aed\"/><text x=\"227.0\" y=\"114.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">L</text><text x=\"227.0\" y=\"132.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Çizgi grafiği</text><rect x=\"311.0\" y=\"10.0\" width=\"128.0\" height=\"84.0\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"6\"/><path d=\"M375.0,52.0 L375.00,20.00 A32,32 0 0 1 391.00,79.71 Z\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M375.0,52.0 L391.00,79.71 A32,32 0 0 1 347.29,68.00 Z\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M375.0,52.0 L347.29,68.00 A32,32 0 0 1 350.49,31.43 Z\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M375.0,52.0 L350.49,31.43 A32,32 0 0 1 375.00,20.00 Z\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"375.0\" y=\"114.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">M</text><text x=\"375.0\" y=\"132.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Daire grafiği</text><rect x=\"459.0\" y=\"10.0\" width=\"128.0\" height=\"84.0\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"6\"/><line x1=\"477.0\" y1=\"82.0\" x2=\"477.0\" y2=\"20.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"477.0\" y1=\"82.0\" x2=\"575.0\" y2=\"82.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><polyline points=\"487,62 509,52 531,58 553,36 571,30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polyline points=\"487,46 509,42 531,44 553,40 571,42\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"/><circle cx=\"487\" cy=\"62\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/><circle cx=\"509\" cy=\"52\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/><circle cx=\"531\" cy=\"58\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/><circle cx=\"553\" cy=\"36\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/><circle cx=\"571\" cy=\"30\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/><rect x=\"484\" y=\"43\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><rect x=\"506\" y=\"39\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><rect x=\"528\" y=\"41\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><rect x=\"550\" y=\"37\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><rect x=\"568\" y=\"39\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><text x=\"523.0\" y=\"114.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">N</text><text x=\"523.0\" y=\"132.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">İki veri gruplu</text><text x=\"523.0\" y=\"148.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">çizgi grafiği</text></svg></div><p><b>Her araştırmanın verileri en uygun grafik türüyle eşleştirildiğinde aşağıdakilerden hangisi elde edilir?</b></p>",
