   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Bir pastanenin ocak–haziran aylarındaki aylık gelir ve giderleri aşağıdaki çizgi grafiğinde gösterilmiştir.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 322\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"İki çizgili grafik: pastanenin ocaktan hazirana aylık gelirleri 40, 45, 50, 42, 55, 60 bin TL; giderleri 35, 38, 52, 40, 45, 48 bin TL. Dikey eksen 30 ile 60 arasında, sıfırdan sonra kırılmalı.\"><text x=\"300\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\"><tspan font-weight=\"bold\">Grafik:</tspan> Pastanenin Aylık Gelir ve Giderleri</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"245\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"249\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">30</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"215\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"219\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">35</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"185\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"185\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"189\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">40</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"159\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">45</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"125\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"129\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">50</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">55</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">60</text><line x1=\"115\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"115\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"195\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"195\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"275\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"275\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"355\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"355\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"435\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"435\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"515\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"515\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"272\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M66,54 L70,46 L74,54\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"272\" x2=\"548\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M540,268 L548,272 L540,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"63\" y=\"252\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"256\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"251\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"263\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"258\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><text x=\"78\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Miktar (bin TL)</text><text x=\"553\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Aylar</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Ocak</text><text x=\"195\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Şubat</text><text x=\"275\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Mart</text><text x=\"355\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Nisan</text><text x=\"435\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Mayıs</text><text x=\"515\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Haziran</text><polyline points=\"115,185 195,155 275,125 355,173 435,95 515,65\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polyline points=\"115,215 195,197 275,113 355,185 435,155 515,137\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\"/><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"185\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"215\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"bold\">40</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"233\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" font-weight=\"bold\">35</text><circle cx=\"195\" cy=\"155\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"195\" cy=\"197\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"195\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"bold\">45</text><text x=\"195\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" font-weight=\"bold\">38</text><circle cx=\"275\" cy=\"125\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"275\" cy=\"113\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" font-weight=\"bold\">52</text><text x=\"275\" y=\"143\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"bold\">50</text><circle cx=\"355\" cy=\"173\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"355\" cy=\"185\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"355\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"bold\">42</text><text x=\"355\" y=\"203\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" font-weight=\"bold\">40</text><circle cx=\"435\" cy=\"95\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"435\" cy=\"155\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"435\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"bold\">55</text><text x=\"435\" y=\"173\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" font-weight=\"bold\">45</text><circle cx=\"515\" cy=\"65\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"515\" cy=\"137\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"515\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"bold\">60</text><text x=\"515\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" font-weight=\"bold\">48</text><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"306\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"306\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"238\" y=\"311\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Gelir</text><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"306\" x2=\"352\" y2=\"306\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\"/><text x=\"358\" y=\"311\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Gider</text></svg></div><p>Bir ayda gelir giderden fazla ise aradaki fark o ayın <b>kârı</b>, gider gelirden fazla ise aradaki fark o ayın <b>zararıdır</b>. Pastanenin altı aylık toplam kârı, kârlı aylardaki kârların toplamından zararlı aylardaki zararların toplamı çıkarılarak bulunur.</p><p><b>Buna göre bu pastanenin altı ayda elde ettiği toplam kâr kaç bin TL’dir?</b></p>",
