   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Bir radyo istasyonu her gün saat 06.00’da yayına başlayıp saat 24.00’te yayını bitirmektedir. Bu radyonun bir günlük yayın akışındaki programların sürelerinin dağılımı aşağıdaki daire grafiğinde gösterilmiştir. Programlar, ara verilmeden Haberler’den başlayarak saat yönünde sırayla yayınlanmaktadır.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 440 300\" width=\"420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Daire grafiği: Haberler 40°, Müzik 60°, Söyleşi 80°, Spor 30°, Tiyatro 50°, Gece Müziği açısı yazılmamış\"><text x=\"10\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\"><tspan font-weight=\"bold\">Grafik:</tspan> Radyonun Günlük Yayın Akışı</text><path d=\"M220,165 L220,47 A118,118 0 0,1 295.8,74.6 Z\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"249.9\" y=\"86.9\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Haberler</text><path d=\"M220,165 L295.8,74.6 A118,118 0 0,1 336.2,185.5 Z\" fill=\"#fcd34d\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"293.2\" y=\"142.4\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Müzik</text><path d=\"M220,165 L336.2,185.5 A118,118 0 0,1 220,283 Z\" fill=\"#86efac\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"270.1\" y=\"228.7\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Söyleşi</text><path d=\"M220,165 L220,283 A118,118 0 0,1 161,267.2 Z\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"197.4\" y=\"253.3\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Spor</text><path d=\"M220,165 L161,267.2 A118,118 0 0,1 103.8,185.5 Z\" fill=\"#c4b5fd\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"156.2\" y=\"213.7\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Tiyatro</text><path d=\"M220,165 L103.8,185.5 A118,118 0 0,1 220,47 Z\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"160.3\" y=\"111.4\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Gece</text><text x=\"160.3\" y=\"126.4\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Müziği</text><path d=\"M220,147.3 A17.7,17.7 0 0,1 231.4,151.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"237\" y=\"122.4\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">40°</text><path d=\"M231.4,151.4 A17.7,17.7 0 0,1 237.4,168.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"252.2\" y=\"157.3\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">60°</text><path d=\"M237.4,168.1 A17.7,17.7 0 0,1 220,182.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"242\" y=\"195.2\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">80°</text><path d=\"M220,182.7 A17.7,17.7 0 0,1 211.2,180.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"207.2\" y=\"216.9\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">30°</text><path d=\"M211.2,180.3 A17.7,17.7 0 0,1 202.6,168.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"188.6\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">50°</text></svg></div><p><b>Buna göre Spor programı hangi saatler arasında yayınlanır?</b></p>",
