" y2=\"70.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"270.0\" y1=\"270.0\" x2=\"270.0\" y2=\"70.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"340.0\" y1=\"270.0\" x2=\"340.0\" y2=\"70.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"410.0\" y1=\"270.0\" x2=\"410.0\" y2=\"70.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"480.0\" y1=\"270.0\" x2=\"480.0\" y2=\"70.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"60.0\" y=\"287.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><text x=\"130.0\" y=\"287.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">100</text><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"287.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">200</text><text x=\"270.0\" y=\"287.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">300</text><text x=\"340.0\" y=\"287.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">400</text><text x=\"410.0\" y=\"287.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">500</text><text x=\"480.0\" y=\"287.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">600</text><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"270.0\" x2=\"60.0\" y2=\"54.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M56.0 56.0 L60.0 48.0 L64.0 56.0 Z\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"270.0\" x2=\"494.0\" y2=\"270.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M492.0 266.0 L500.0 270.0 L492.0 274.0 Z\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"50.0\" y=\"38.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Batarya Doluluğu (%)</text><text x=\"502.0\" y=\"274.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Yol (km)</text><path d=\"M60.0,78.0 L130.0,110.0 L200.0,142.0 L270.0,174.0 L270.0,70.0 L340.0,94.0 L410.0,118.0 L480.0,142.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"60.0\" cy=\"78.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\"/><circle cx=\"130.0\" cy=\"110.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\"/><circle cx=\"200.0\" cy=\"142.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\"/><circle cx=\"270.0\" cy=\"174.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\"/><circle cx=\"270.0\" cy=\"70.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\"/><circle cx=\"340.0\" cy=\"94.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\"/><circle cx=\"410.0\" cy=\"118.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\"/><circle cx=\"480.0\" cy=\"142.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\"/></svg></div><p>Batarya doluluğu %16’ya düştüğünde otomobilin uyarı ışığı yanmaktadır.</p><p><b>Otomobil 600. kilometreden sonra da şarj edilmeden, son 300 km’deki tüketimiyle yoluna devam ederse uyarı ışığı yola çıkıştan itibaren kaçıncı kilometrede yanar?</b></p>",
