" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Nis</text><text x=\"353.0\" y=\"244.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><line x1=\"360.0\" y1=\"240.0\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"54.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M356.0 56.0 L360.0 48.0 L364.0 56.0 Z\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"360.0\" y1=\"240.0\" x2=\"594.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M592.0 236.0 L600.0 240.0 L592.0 244.0 Z\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"350.0\" y=\"38.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Miktar (kg)</text></svg></div><p><b>Buna göre lokanta bu dört ayda aldığı domatesin bir kilogramı için ortalama kaç TL ödemiştir?</b></p>",
