   "a": "D",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Eksen 0’dan sonra kırık; çentikler eşit aralıklı, eşit artışlı.</li> <li>2. çentik 120, 5. çentik 210.</li> <li>Pzt 4., Salı 1., Çrş 6., Prş 3. çentiğe kadar.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Dört günün ziyaretçi ortalaması.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Bir aralığın değeri</b> 2. ile 5. çentik arasında 3 aralık vardır. <span class=\"sv-m\">(210 − 120) ÷ 3 = 30 kişi</span></li> <li><b>Çentik değerleri</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">1. → 90, 3. → 150, 4. → 180, 6. → 240</span></li> <li><b>Ortalama</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">(180 + 90 + 240 + 150) ÷ 4 = 660 ÷ 4 = 165</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 242\" width=\"520\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Çentik değerleri bulununca ziyaretçiler 180, 90, 240, 150\"><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"214.0\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"214.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"218.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"190.2\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"190.2\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"194.2\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">30</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"166.5\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"166.5\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"170.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">60</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"142.8\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"142.8\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"146.8\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">90</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"119.0\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"119.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"123.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">120</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"95.2\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"95.2\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"99.2\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">150</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"71.5\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"71.5\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"75.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">180</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"47.8\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"47.8\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"51.8\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">210</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"24.0\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"24.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"28.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">240</text><rect x=\"92.0\" y=\"71.5\" width=\"34.0\" height=\"142.5\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"109.0\" y=\"66.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">180</text><text x=\"109.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Pzt</text><rect x=\"206.0\" y=\"142.8\" width=\"34.0\" height=\"71.2\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"223.0\" y=\"137.8\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">90</text><text x=\"223.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Salı</text><rect x=\"320.0\" y=\"24.0\" width=\"34.0\" height=\"190.0\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"337.0\" y=\"19.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">240</text><text x=\"337.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Çrş</text><rect x=\"434.0\" y=\"95.2\" width=\"34.0\" height=\"118.8\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"451.0\" y=\"90.2\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">150</text><text x=\"451.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Prş</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"214.0\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"214.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"58.0\" y=\"14.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Ziyaretçi</text></svg><figcaption>Gerçek değerlerle çizilmiş sütunlar.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Ekseni 0’dan başlıyor sanıp her çentiği 60 kişi sayan 210 bulur; kırık eksende ilk çentik 60 değil 90’dır.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>D</b></div></div>"
