   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Bir sınıftaki öğrencilerin kardeş sayılarına göre dağılımı aşağıdaki sütun grafiğinde gösterilmiştir. Örneğin bu sınıfta kardeşi olmayan 4 öğrenci vardır.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 530 272\" width=\"530\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sütun grafiği: kardeşi olmayan 4, 1 kardeşi olan 10, 2 kardeşi olan 8, 3 kardeşi olan 3 öğrenci.\"><text x=\"250.0\" y=\"18.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\"><tspan font-weight=\"bold\">Grafik:</tspan> Öğrencilerin Kardeş Sayıları</text><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"201.0\" x2=\"358.0\" y2=\"201.0\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"76.0\" y1=\"201.0\" x2=\"80.0\" y2=\"201.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"73.0\" y=\"205.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3</text><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"186.0\" x2=\"148.0\" y2=\"186.0\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"76.0\" y1=\"186.0\" x2=\"80.0\" y2=\"186.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"73.0\" y=\"190.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">4</text><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"126.0\" x2=\"288.0\" y2=\"126.0\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"76.0\" y1=\"126.0\" x2=\"80.0\" y2=\"126.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"73.0\" y=\"130.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">8</text><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"96.0\" x2=\"218.0\" y2=\"96.0\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><line x1=\"76.0\" y1=\"96.0\" x2=\"80.0\" y2=\"96.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"73.0\" y=\"100.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">10</text><rect x=\"112.0\" y=\"186.0\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"60.0\" fill=\"#86efac\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"130.0\" y=\"263.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><rect x=\"182.0\" y=\"96.0\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"150.0\" fill=\"#86efac\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"263.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">1</text><rect x=\"252.0\" y=\"126.0\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"120.0\" fill=\"#86efac\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"270.0\" y=\"263.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2</text><rect x=\"322.0\" y=\"201.0\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"45.0\" fill=\"#86efac\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"340.0\" y=\"263.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3</text><text x=\"73.0\" y=\"250.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"246.0\" x2=\"80.0\" y2=\"48.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M76.0 50.0 L80.0 42.0 L84.0 50.0 Z\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"246.0\" x2=\"388.0\" y2=\"246.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M386.0 242.0 L394.0 246.0 L386.0 250.0 Z\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"398.0\" y=\"250.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Kardeş Sayısı</text><text x=\"70.0\" y=\"32.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Öğrenci Sayısı</text></svg></div><p>Bu sınıfa 5 yeni öğrenci gelmiştir. Yeni gelenlerle birlikte sınıftaki öğrencilerin kardeş sayılarının aritmetik ortalaması 1,5 olmuştur.</p><p><b>Buna göre yeni gelen 5 öğrencinin kardeş sayılarının toplamı kaçtır?</b></p>",
