   "a": "B",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>0 kardeş: 4, 1 kardeş: 10, 2 kardeş: 8, 3 kardeş: 3 öğrenci.</li> <li>5 yeni öğrenci geliyor; yeni ortalama 1,5.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Yeni gelen 5 öğrencinin kardeş sayıları toplamı.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Şimdiki durum</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">Öğrenci: 4 + 10 + 8 + 3 = 25</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">Kardeş: 0 + 10 + 16 + 9 = 35</span></li> <li><b>Yeni toplam</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">30 öğrenci · 1,5 = 45 kardeş</span></li> <li><b>Yeni gelenler</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">45 − 35 = 10</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 260\" width=\"520\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Kardeş sayısına göre öğrenciler; alt satırda kardeş toplamları, toplam 35\"><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"214.0\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"214.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"218.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"176.0\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"176.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"180.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"138.0\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"138.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"142.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">4</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"100.0\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"100.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"104.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">6</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"62.0\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"62.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"66.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">8</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"24.0\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"24.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46.0\" y=\"28.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">10</text><rect x=\"92.0\" y=\"138.0\" width=\"34.0\" height=\"76.0\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"109.0\" y=\"133.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"109.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0 kardeş</text><text x=\"109.0\" y=\"250.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\" font-weight=\"bold\">0·4 = 0</text><rect x=\"206.0\" y=\"24.0\" width=\"34.0\" height=\"190.0\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"223.0\" y=\"19.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">10</text><text x=\"223.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">1 kardeş</text><text x=\"223.0\" y=\"250.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\" font-weight=\"bold\">1·10 = 10</text><rect x=\"320.0\" y=\"62.0\" width=\"34.0\" height=\"152.0\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"337.0\" y=\"57.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">8</text><text x=\"337.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2 kardeş</text><text x=\"337.0\" y=\"250.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\" font-weight=\"bold\">2·8 = 16</text><rect x=\"434.0\" y=\"157.0\" width=\"34.0\" height=\"57.0\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"451.0\" y=\"152.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"451.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3 kardeş</text><text x=\"451.0\" y=\"250.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\" font-weight=\"bold\">3·3 = 9</text><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"214.0\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"214.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"58.0\" y=\"14.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Öğrenci sayısı</text></svg><figcaption>Alt satırda her sütundaki toplam kardeş sayısı.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Kardeşi olmayan 4 öğrenciyi saymamak (yanlış öğrenci sayısı) ya da 45’i cevap sanmak.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
